cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these formal proofs, please cite them as below."
title: "Lean 4 proofs for Palomar: seven formal-conjectures statements (Left to Solve) and six further results"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kao
    given-names: Ming-Chih
    affiliation: Stanford University
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-27"
keywords:
